/*  EXPECTED: COMPILES and runs; compiled output must match the interpreter.

    A constant built from a rabbit's text is copied to where the program keeps its own. */


Pull a rabbit.
    Define half as "in" joined to "ner".
    Define whole as half joined to "most" permanently.
Done.
Bind text to total, whole.

/*  Make and drop enough values that freed memory is handed out again. */
Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    The tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State cast total.
